<title>UK: LME copper ends PM kerb with pared gains.</title>
<headline>LME copper ends PM kerb with pared gains.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Ends PM kerb off highs as producer selling, profit-taking cap gains. Cash/threes slightly narrower at $53/$56 backwardation.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Unchanged, consolidating.</p>
<p>TIN - Sharply weaker, just above $5,700.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Easier, dips under $7,800.</p>
<p>LEAD - Quiet, slightly easier. ZINC - Little changed.</p>
</text>
